//! Native Codex app-server DTOs (L2.1 session/input/result + minimal readback).
//!
//! Shapes generated by installed Codex 0.161.0 on 2026-10-27 via
//! `codex app-server generate-json-schema --out <temporary-schema-directory>`
//! (fresh authoritative schema). Cross-checked against official docs:
//! <https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/app-server> and
//! <https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/models>, plus upstream protocol sources at
//! <https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/main/codex-rs/app-server-protocol/src>.
//!
//! Upstream license inspected once via `openai/codex` LICENSE (Apache-2.0):
//! no SDK/model-loop code is copied here and no full generated schema is
//! imported. Only the minimal wire shapes below are hand-typed for Eliot.
//! Unknown JSON fields are ignored on deserialize for forward compatibility.
//! DTOs only: no I/O, no process spawning, no config access.
//! L2.2 control verbs (steer/interrupt/deltas) return with a real caller.

